Update WILC1000 and WILC3000 Wi-Fi firmware to v16.5.2 from
https://github.com/linux4wilc/firmware tag wilc_linux_16_5_2.

Changes since v16.1.2:
 - WPA3 support and WFA re-certification on WILC3000 (v16.5)
 - Fix transmission of large data blocks (v16.3)
 - Fix softAP inactivity counter preventing new station associations
   after ungraceful disconnects (v16.5.1)
 - Fix default MAC address on modules with improperly programmed eFuse
   (v16.5.1)
 - Power-save reliability and stability improvements (v16.5.2)
 - Wi-Fi security enhancements (v16.5.2)
 - Fix duplicate frame detection (v16.5.2)
 - Improve disconnect reason reporting (v16.5.2)

